flowchart TD
    Q[Run queued] -->|worker lease| R[Run running]
    R -->|workflow returns normally| C[Run completed]
    R -->|provider or internal exception| F[Run failed]
    R -->|deadline reached| T[Run timed out]
    R -->|cancellation observed| X[Run cancelled]
    C -->|all required propositions supported| S[Result sufficient]
    C -->|some propositions supported| P[Result partial]
    C -->|no sufficient conclusion| I[Result insufficient]
    C -->|material conflict unresolved| K[Result conflict]
    F -.->|only explicitly validated stage output| VP[Result validated partial]
    T -.->|only explicitly validated stage output| VP
    X -.->|only explicitly validated stage output| VP
